    "Pacman": {
        "name": "Pacman",
        "description": "Pac-Man is the classic maze chase: you eat every pellet on the board while ghosts patrol the corridors and try to catch you. Power pellets flip the roles for a few seconds, letting you chase the ghosts instead. Clearing the board moves you on to the next round, where the pressure rises.\n\nSteer with the arrow keys. Pac-Man keeps moving on his own, so your job is choosing turns, and pressing a direction slightly early lets him take a corner the moment it opens. Learn the shape of the maze and the side tunnels that wrap around, and avoid dead ends when a ghost is close behind.\n\nSave power pellets for moments when ghosts are bunched up behind you, rather than using them the moment you reach one. Each ghost behaves a little differently, so after a few games you start to anticipate where they will turn. That growing pattern recognition is what turns a simple maze into a game worth replaying.",
        "metaDescription": "Play Pacman and clear a pellet-filled maze. Avoid the ghosts, use power pellets, and plan a safe route through every corner.",
        "url": "games/html/Pacman.html",
        "image": "thumbnails/pacman.gif",
        "tags": ["adventure", "action", "difficult", "strategy", "console", "favorite"]
    },
