    "RaftWars": {
        "name": "Raft Wars",
        "description": "Raft Wars is a turn-based artillery game on the water. Two young defenders protect their treasure while a rival raft trades projectiles with them across the gap, and whoever lands shots more accurately gains the upper hand. Every miss gives your opponent another chance, so each turn is worth taking carefully.\n\nAim with the mouse and watch the game's on-screen indicators for angle and power. The arc of a shot matters more than raw strength, so adjust a little at a time and note where each shot lands. Take a moment to judge the distance before firing, because rushing a shot usually wastes your turn.\n\nRaft Wars rewards patience and memory. After a miss, your next shot is a correction rather than a guess, and a few well-judged adjustments usually find the target. That steady refinement is the whole game, and it makes each win feel earned.",
        "metaDescription": "Play Raft Wars and defend your treasure. Aim across the water, adjust shot power, and defeat opponents in turn-based battles.",
        "url": "games/html/raftwars.html",
        "image": "thumbnails/raftwars.png",
        "tags": ["action", "shooter", "strategy", "favorite"]
    },
